DESCRIPTION >
    Temporary: output of cdp_segment_aggregates_diff_tmp_copy (leaf keys that changed since the
    fingerprint) and cdp_segment_aggregates_rollup_tmp_copy (the parent and grandparent keys above
    them, recomputed from v2). Used to measure the change detection for the daily aggregate sinks;
    to be deleted afterwards (linuxfoundation/lfx-cdp-insights-ops#1146).

SCHEMA >
    `kind` LowCardinality(String),
    `level` LowCardinality(String),
    `reason` LowCardinality(String),
    `segmentId` String,
    `entityId` String,
    `currentParent` String,
    `sentParent` String,
    `currentGrandparent` String,
    `sentGrandparent` String,
    `activityCount` UInt64,
    `memberCount` UInt64,
    `lastActive` DateTime64(3),
    `updatedAt` DateTime

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY kind, level, segmentId, entityId
